.DS_Store

# apps/api and apps/admin are deliberately NOT excluded here any more. apps/api ships as its
# own deployed image, built by .docker/admin.Dockerfile. apps/admin has no image yet - its
# exclusion was dropped now rather than twice, and it joins one when the frontend image is
# written. "Local-only" describes *what a member is never bundled into*, and that is each
# Dockerfile's per-member COPY list, not this file. .dockerignore is shared by every build,
# so a rule here silently removes a member from images it belongs in; excluding apps/api is
# why this file had to change at all.

# Docker meta
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
